panied by bill, House, No. 93) of Smitty Pignatelli, Natalie M. Blais and others relative to expanding agriculture preservation restrictions for hemp cultivation.  Agriculture.","DocumentText":"\tSection 2 of Chapter 61A of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2016 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting, in line 4, after the word “tobacco” the following words:- \"hemp as defined in section 116 of chapter 128\". \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J38","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J38"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}